        "subtopic": "Schistosomiasis",
        "source": "Qbank",
        "difficulty": "Hard",
        "question": "Schistosomiasis, a water-based parasitic disease, is transmitted to humans through contact with water containing infective larval forms (cercariae) released from which intermediate host?",
