        "correct": 3,
        "exp": "Renal Papillary Necrosis is classically triggered by NSAID abuse (analgesic nephropathy), Sickle cell disease/trait, severe acute pyelonephritis, and Diabetes mellitus. Mnemonic: SAAD papa.",
