        "question": "A 60-year-old farmer presents with a slow-growing, pearly nodule on his upper lip with prominent, dilated blood vessels (telangiectasias) on its surface. Biopsy shows nests of basaloid cells with 'peripheral palisading'. What is the biological behavior of this tumor?",
