        "source": "Pathoma",
        "question": "A 10-year-old boy from central Africa presents with a rapidly growing, massive tumor of the jaw. Histology shows sheets of uniform lymphoid cells interspersed with tangible body macrophages, giving a 'starry sky' appearance. This tumor is driven by a t(8;14) translocation that overexpresses which oncogene?",
