        "source": "Kaplan",
        "question": "A 65-year-old male smoker presents with weight loss, proximal muscle weakness, and a centrally located lung mass. His weakness improves with repeated muscle use. Which type of lung cancer is most frequently associated with this specific paraneoplastic syndrome?",
