        "question": "A 45-year-old female presents with episodic flushing, diarrhea, and wheezing. She is found to have a well-circumscribed, polypoid mass in a mainstem bronchus. Biopsy reveals nests of uniform cells with 'salt-and-pepper' chromatin. Which immunostain will be positive in this tumor?",
