        "topic": "Respiratory Pathology",
        "difficulty": "Hard",
        "source": "Pathoma",
        "question": "A patient with severe asthma is experiencing an acute exacerbation. The late phase of this reaction is primarily driven by eosinophils damaging the respiratory epithelium. Which Th2 cytokine is directly responsible for the recruitment and activation of these eosinophils?",
