        "question": "A 65-year-old male with a history of asbestos exposure presents with a pleural mass. A biopsy is performed. Which of the following immunohistochemical markers is consistently POSITIVE in malignant mesothelioma, helping to distinguish it from metastatic adenocarcinoma?",
