        "question": "A 28-year-old male with advanced HIV infection (CD4 count < 50) presents with a gradual onset of non-productive cough and dyspnea. Silver stain (GMS) of a bronchoalveolar lavage sample shows crushed ping-pong ball (boat-shaped) cysts. What is the organism?",
