        "question": "A 55-year-old male presents with high fever, dry cough, confusion, and severe watery diarrhea. Labs show hyponatremia. He recently attended a convention at a hotel with a large water-cooling tower. The organism cannot be seen on standard Gram stain but can be visualized with silver stain. Diagnosis?",
