        "question": "A 45-year-old African American male with a history of intravenous drug use develops severe Focal Segmental Glomerulosclerosis (FSGS). Recent genetic studies have linked the much higher prevalence of FSGS in populations of African descent to a specific gene variant that evolved to protect against African sleeping sickness. Which gene is this?",
