        "question": "A newborn is found to have massive, bilateral, symmetrically enlarged kidneys on ultrasound, containing radially oriented cysts. The infant also exhibits congenital hepatic fibrosis. This condition is inherited in an autosomal recessive pattern. Which gene is mutated?",
