        "source": "Pathoma",
        "question": "A 45-year-old male immigrant from Egypt presents with gross hematuria and dysuria. Cystoscopy reveals a tumor in the dome of the bladder. Biopsy shows invasive malignant cells producing keratin pearls. What specific chronic infection is the most prominent risk factor for this type of bladder cancer?",
