        "correct": 3,
        "exp": "Pauci-immune RPGN (negative IF) is driven by ANCA vasculitides. The presentation of kidney involvement, cavitary lung lesions, and upper airway destruction (saddle-nose) is the classic triad for Granulomatosis with Polyangiitis (Wegener's), which is associated with c-ANCA (PR3-ANCA).",
