        "difficulty": "Normal",
        "source": "Pathoma",
        "question": "A 60-year-old male is evaluated for gross hematuria. He has a long history of taking analgesic powders containing phenacetin and aspirin for chronic back pain. Imaging shows a tumor in the renal pelvis. Which type of malignancy is most highly associated with chronic analgesic abuse?",
